  "title": "AGNICO EAGLE ANNOUNCES RENEWAL OF NORMAL COURSE ISSUER BID",
  "summary": "(NYSE: AEM) (TSX: AEM) (\"Agnico Eagle\") announced today that further to its news release dated April 30, 2026, it has received approval from the Toronto Stock Exchange (the \"TSX\") of Agnico Eagle's notice of intention to renew its normal course issuer bid (the \"NCIB\"). Under the NCIB, Agnico Eagle may purchase for cancellation, on the open market at its discretion, during the period commencing on May 6, 2026 and ending on the earlier of May 5, 2027 and the completion of purchases under the NCIB,",
